The Ogre Magi were originally a small band of extremely loyal Ogre enforcers, transformed by Gul'dan into scheming and malicious sorcerers. Ogre-Magi can direct their death magiks as easily as their lesser cousins would deliver a crushing blow.|n|n|cffffcc00Abilities:|r Pillage, Eye of Kilrogg, Bloodlust, Runes.|n|n|cffffcc00Attacks land units.|r
}

